# The Sleet Kilns' old kiln cave (CIPlay the_sleet_kilns_caves, 11-13 w11; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its
# recipe: the mouth strip (3 m) from 30 -45 east into the spoil knoll; the level passage to the kiln room (46..53 -45).
# A bear sleeps in the room.
island The Sleet Kilns keep
offset 0.0411 -0.0419
hour 11
weather Calm
picture sk_cave_out 22 8 -39 34 4 -45
expect animals Bear 1
expect animalsinside Bear 1
# (w11e: the bear woke and came out to the passage, where its body blocked the way in - picture and kill it asleep in
# its room before going in, and stop short of it)
picture sk_bear 36 4.6 -45 49 3.6 -45 aim=Bear light=20
kill Bear
expect animals Bear 0
walk 29 -45 to 32 -45 to 36 -45 below=6
walk 36 -45 to 41 -45 to 46 -45 to 48 -45 below=6
picture sk_cave_in 42 4.6 -45 52 3.4 -45 light=20
walk 48 -45 to 46 -45 to 41 -45 to 36 -45 to 29 -45 below=6
